          {"@type":"Question","name":"How often should I review notes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A brief daily triage (5â€“10 minutes) keeps items actionable, and a weekly deep review (15â€“30 minutes) is ideal for processing and planning."}},
          {"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Notes with Pomodoro?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yesâ€”pick a single note as your Pomodoro goal before starting a Pomodoro session and use breaks to log progress or convert bullets into tasks."}}
